        "Notes": "The volume is an anthology of earlier writings by the same author. They include: Il Farnetico Savio (1610); Anticupido (1610); Orazione [...] Fatta in lode di D. Alderano Cybo Marchese di Carrara (1609); Delle Lettere del Signor Alessandro Guarini (n. d.); Pareri in Materia d`Onor, e di Paci (1611); and Varie Compositioni Raccolte in diverse materie (1611). Most of these texts are published in the volume with their original title pages and prefatory material. They have been catalogued separately.",
